            "text": "Because $X^TX$ is positive semi-definite (eigenvalues $\\ge 0$), so adding $\\lambda I$ shifts all eigenvalues strictly to $\\lambda_i + \\lambda > 0$, guaranteeing positive definiteness and full rank"
