        "explanation": "Out of 1000 total cases, it gets 990 correct (99% accuracy). However, $TP = 0$ out of 10 actual frauds, so $\\text{Recall} = \\frac{0}{10} = 0\\%$. This classic dilemma is known as the 'Accuracy Paradox'.",
