            "id": "A",
            "text": "The Hessian matrix $H = \\frac{1}{m} X^T D X$ (where $D$ is a diagonal matrix with positive entries $D_{ii} = \\hat{y}_i(1 - \\hat{y}_i) > 0$) is positive semi-definite for any design matrix $X$"
